<title>BELGIUM: EU sets aid for rice shipments to Azores, Madeira.</title>
<headline>EU sets aid for rice shipments to Azores, Madeira.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals and rice management committee set aid for rice shipments to the Azores, Madeira and the Canary Islands on Thursday, an EU member state official said.</p>
<p>The committee set the aid with effect from April 1, in Ecus per tonne, at -</p>
<p> white rice to the Azores and Madeira     269</p>
<p> white rice to the Canaries		   269</p>
<p> broken rice to the Canaries		   59</p>
</text>
